  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(AB\\) is the common included side between \\(\\angle A\\) and \\(\\angle B\\), and \\(DE\\) is the included side between \\(\\angle D\\) and \\(\\angle E\\). Two angles and their included side are respectively equal, so the criterion is ASA.",
